@alpakaId=REPLACE-WITH-ALPAKA-ID

GET {{devbase}}/api/alpakas/{{alpakaId}}

###

@messageId=REPLACE-WITH-MESSAGE-ID

DELETE {{devbase}}/api/messages/{{messageId}}

